hey, im akash\
a Design Engineer at botlab dynamics.\
\
I design drones for lightshows and the defence forces.\
\
Lightshows are a major part of our company and flying thousands of drones at once gives me a very unique problem statement to solve, which is to design a drone both for reliability and to adhere to logistical constraints.\
\
from managing shipment volume, maximising the surface area of the light diffuser, upgrading the core technology to reduce human intervention and most importantly designing it such that it can be mass produced with convention production methods. These were some of the challenges that we had to face while designing this drone.\
\
to make such copters i have also worked on how we qualify parts of the drone, specially the power-system.\
\
i have built an automated test bench for qualifying motors, propellers, batteries, and speed controllers.  this gives us much more data than we get from the manufacturers of the parts we are buying which then leads us to make a decision on the selection of parts we qualify for a drone.\
\
\
\
appart from designing sometimes we have to be on the field running the shows, being able to see the audience react to what we have created is always a pleasure to watch.\
\
\
